Go to - https://github.com/odin-lang/Odin/releases
Download the most recent linux release
To open use "unzip"
Then use "tar -xf" on the dist file
Now you need to add to path
Run "nano ~/.bashrc"
Add "export PATH="$<file path>:$PATH" to the bottom
CTRL + O, ENTER, CTRL + X
"source ~/.bashrc" to reload terminal
Now "odin run ." will build code
